            "x": 200,
            "y": 410,
            "w": 560,
            "h": 150,
            "label": "3. [server]\nAccepted files are stored or linked, indexed,\ncovered/extracted when applicable, and queued for\ndigest/OCR/paper enrichment according to type and settings\n(Library import routes; `web_app/services/folder_reconcile.py\u2026",
            "color": "#46a758",
            "fill": null,
            "border": "solid",
            "lblPos": "center",
