            "y": 640,
            "w": 560,
            "h": 150,
            "label": "5. [reader dispatch]\nPDF/EPUB opens PdfReader; Word/Excel/PowerPoint/CSV/LaTeX\nopens OfficeReader; HTML/Markdown opens HtmlReader or source\npreview; other supported formats use their media/brief\nrenderer",
