            "label": "2. [reader]\nOfficeReader fetches indexed render HTML. A top-level linked\nopen explicitly resolves the latest linked head, while an\nexact history-node preview stays pinned to that id. Excel\nrendering discloses bounded-format or large-sheet reduction\u2026",
