            "h": 150,
            "label": "3. [reader]\nThe user edits Word text/images/tables, slide shapes/notes,\nspreadsheet cells/formulas/ranges/sheets, or CSV/TEX source;\nundo/redo and keyboard gestures feed pending\nvalue/format/structure queues",
