            "x": 200,
            "y": 640,
            "w": 560,
            "h": 150,
            "label": "5. [reader guard]\nIf the open node is no longer head, the user chooses\nbranch-here, switch-to-latest, or cancel. If a linked external\nfile drifted, the server returns `409 external_change`,\nrefreshes the current head, preserves pending work, an\u2026",
